  m_text: '"Hey! Can you help me?

    

    I found an online store selling these
    cute pink headphones at an unbelievably cheap price!

    

    At first, I
    thought it was a great deal. But something seems suspicious about the website.

    

    Can
    you compare both websites and help me find what''s wrong before I make a purchase?"'
