      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '"Oh no... I thought the website was real because it looked just like the
    official store.

    

    I should have checked the details more carefully
    before trusting such an amazing deal.

    

    I almost bought something
    from a fake shopping website!

    

    Can we try again? I want to learn
    how to shop safely online!"'
